From ee87308051745e03e634d6639154bb5373bd160a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: forge-shepherd <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 16:19:53 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat(pr-monitor): W-S4b reconcile executor + daemon +
 dispatch trigger
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds the impure half of the autonomous shepherd reconciler (design §3/§4),
consuming the merged W-S4a pure reconcile() + tick() debounce:

- reconcile-executor.js: gatherDesired (gh∩kernel), gatherObserved, execute
  (start/stop/reap watchers, upsert/retire kernel_pr rows), singleton daemon
  lifecycle (acquire→heartbeat→converge→self-retire), and the non-blocking,
  error-swallowing fireAndForget trigger.
- watchers[] enriched to {pr,repo,pid,startedAt}; orphan reaping re-verifies
  start-time BEFORE any process.kill (pid-reuse fail-safe: never kill on a PID
  match alone; null/legacy/mismatched marker → drop silently).
- bin/forge.js: fires the trigger from a finally on the dispatch try, wrapped in
  a bare catch so a throwing tick can never touch the command result/exit code.
- hooks.js: session-start sibling trigger (fail-open).
- shepherd.js: 'daemon' subcommand runs the singleton.
- FORGE_SHEPHERD_DISABLE operator kill-switch.

Tests: dispatch-safety (throwing tick swallowed), orphan-reap start-time
verify (mismatch→no kill / match→one kill), killed-watcher respawn, hand-opened
PR self-registration (zero user invocation), daemon acquire{ok:false}→exit,
cold-tick lease-winner-only-launches. Spawn/kill/gh all injected — zero real
processes in tests.

Refs: 12988ba0-feb9-43eb-b1b7-cce1ae70fc30

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
